{"id":"n37785-1-7","stage":4,"title":"꿰매다 · 缝补","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37785-1-7-1","ko":"네 동생이 크게 다쳤다며?","zh":"你弟弟受伤很严重吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你的（너의 的缩略）","explanation":"너：你；의：的。네 是 너의 的缩略，修饰后面的名词，表示“你的”；这里不是数词四。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"동생이","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동생이","audio":"/audio/599230a656a3cfb2f54a.mp3"}},{"text":"크게","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"크게","audio":"/audio/39efead98c7d3ec847e3.mp3"}},{"text":"다쳤다며?","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다쳤다며","audio":"/audio/1e242c689f0c6e94b41b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"你","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"重，重大，严重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的规模、范围、程度、力量等都超过了一般水平。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd3edeab33f5aa0e09cf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37785-1-7-2","ko":"응. 발을 무려 네 바늘이나 꿰맸어.","zh":"对。脚上缝了足足四针呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"발을","meaning":"足，脚","explanation":"발：足，脚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67886","senseId":"1","lemma":"발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발을","audio":"/audio/bce84895e74d38be0e63.mp3"}},{"text":"무려","meaning":"足有(用于表示数量的词语前面)","explanation":"무려：足有(用于表示数量的词语前面)。","readings":[{"term":"무려","audio":"/audio/94d68bf0030bd49d3450.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15323","senseId":"1","lemma":"무려","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무려","audio":"/audio/94d68bf0030bd49d3450.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"四","explanation":"네：四。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64556","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"바늘이나","meaning":"针，缝衣针","explanation":"바늘：针，缝衣针；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"바늘","audio":"/audio/ed9978c1cc17e3c1e57a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56388","senseId":"1","lemma":"바늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바늘이나","audio":"/audio/c63cbbdb6a1873caf8a3.mp3"}},{"text":"꿰맸어.","meaning":"缝补","explanation":"꿰매다：缝补；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"꿰매다","audio":"/audio/54b6a769a060a7bd691f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37785","senseId":"1","lemma":"꿰매다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꿰맸어","audio":"/audio/5f8a2326f0d05d989323.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"45a4bd47fdb2ffcd","term":"발","zh":"足，脚","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3","entryId":"67886","definition":"人或动物腿部的最末端部分。","pronunciation":["발"]},{"id":"94d68bf0030bd49d","term":"무려","zh":"足有(用于表示数量的词语前面)","audio":"/audio/94d68bf0030bd49d3450.mp3","entryId":"15323","definition":"数量比想象的多很多。","pronunciation":["무려"]},{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"四","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"64556","definition":"四的。","pronunciation":["네ː"]},{"id":"ed9978c1cc17e3c1","term":"바늘","zh":"针，缝衣针","audio":"/audio/ed9978c1cc17e3c1e57a.mp3","entryId":"56388","definition":"缝衣服等时使用的末端尖细的铁质东西。","pronunciation":["바늘"]},{"id":"54b6a769a060a7bd","term":"꿰매다","zh":"缝补","audio":"/audio/54b6a769a060a7bd691f.mp3","entryId":"37785","definition":"用针线缝住破旧或开了口的地方。","pronunciation":["꿰ː매다"]}],"audio":"/audio/06baa5a057a8fb40c4f2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37785","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3053,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你弟弟受伤很严重吗？","对。脚上缝了足足四针呢。","你现在的状态怎么样？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你弟弟受伤很严重吗？","对。脚上缝了足足四针呢。","你现在的状态怎么样？"],"answer":1}]}
